---
layout: layout.njk
title: "Contact Event'Light Amiens — sono, lumière, mapping"
description: "Event'Light, 53 rue du Général Friant, 80000 Amiens. Albéric Delabie 07 81 53 36 00, Antoine Capel 06 46 82 08 31, eventlight80@gmail.com."
permalink: "/contact/"
breadcrumbs:
  - name: Contact
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% include "breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <p class="kicker">Amiens · Somme</p>
    <h1>Contacter Event'Light à Amiens</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ site.address }}. Location et prestations son, lumière et vidéo mapping dans le secteur d'Amiens.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="page-body">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="people">
      {% for c in site.contacts %}
      <article class="person">
        <h2>{{ c.nom }}</h2>
        <p><a href="{{ c.telHref }}">{{ c.tel }}</a></p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
    <p>
      <a href="{{ site.facebook }}">Facebook</a> ·
      <a href="{{ site.instagram }}">Instagram</a> ·
      <a href="{{ site.youtube }}">YouTube</a>
    </p>
    <div class="map-embed">
      <iframe
        title="Carte — Event'Light, 53 rue du Général Friant, Amiens"
        loading="lazy"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
        src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=53%20Rue%20du%20G%C3%A9n%C3%A9ral%20Friant%2080000%20Amiens&z=16&output=embed"></iframe>
    </div>
    <p><a class="cta" href="/devis/">Obtenir un devis</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
